00:26:41.880 --> 00:26:46.580
And I think an interesting point that Sean just brought up too, is like, did the people

00:26:46.580 --> 00:26:52.480
who made this game like Sakamoto and them, did they play it and were they able to get to

00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:55.480
the end? Because I just don't see it.

00:26:56.000 --> 00:26:57.420
It's so hard.

00:26:57.420 --> 00:27:02.520
And, and look, that's not why I'm not going to put it in the essential list because that's

00:27:02.520 --> 00:27:06.340
like a bad barrier because some people are really good at video games and some people

00:27:06.340 --> 00:27:08.200
are really good at other kinds of video games.

00:27:08.400 --> 00:27:11.480
So the skill and difficulty should never have anything to do with it.

00:27:11.560 --> 00:27:15.320
We shouldn't just let easy to win games be in the essential games list, which I don't

00:27:15.320 --> 00:27:18.820
think we've really done. You know, Super Mario Brothers is challenging still.

00:27:19.140 --> 00:27:23.000
Yeah. And balloon fight is not a game that is like rewarding to beginners.

00:27:24.060 --> 00:27:28.000
So we're not just letting easy games in and we're not letting games that are so difficult

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:29.040
be like, no, they're too difficult.

00:27:29.160 --> 00:27:35.560
They're not getting through. What kills me about this game is that if you just strip down some of the, you know,

00:27:35.600 --> 00:27:39.300
like if you, if you didn't have so many objects on the screen at once, if you had

00:27:39.300 --> 00:27:45.160
a different way to control your character, if you, if you didn't have to shoot, like,

00:27:45.840 --> 00:27:48.200
you know, if you didn't have like a limited amount of time and bullets and stuff like

00:27:48.200 --> 00:27:52.980
that, and you had like more concentration or ability to like, you know, play with the

00:27:53.000 --> 00:27:58.020
time the way that we did, you know, like if you had some kind of ability to less things

00:27:58.020 --> 00:27:59.080
on the screen, you could shoot less.

00:27:59.260 --> 00:28:00.460
I don't know what the answer is here.

00:28:00.540 --> 00:28:04.560
What I'm saying is, is not remove all those things, but there's, this game is too busy

00:28:04.560 --> 00:28:06.620
right now to be rewarding.

00:28:06.880 --> 00:28:08.040
Yeah. There's too much going on.

